---
title: Control plane · one Job Run from committed outbox to accepted Result
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant ctl as Owning controller
  participant pg as Supabase Postgres
  participant wake as Queues + Cron
  participant worker as Worker · Job Run
  participant target as Command target · provider

  ctl->>pg: one transaction · state, Event, Job, outbox
  pg->>wake: outbox wake-up
  wake->>worker: deliver · at least once
  worker->>pg: claim the Job · transactional lease
  worker->>target: Command · command_id = idempotency key
  target-->>worker: provider operation ID
  worker->>pg: record the provider operation ID
  opt effect uncertain
    worker->>target: read back the provider's own record
    Note over worker,target: Reconcile by stable provider identity,<br/>never by repeating the Command.
  end
  alt Result returned
    worker->>pg: typed Result · inbox deduplicates
    ctl->>pg: apply the Result · new transaction + revision check
  else run failed, no legal run remains
    worker->>ctl: failure
    ctl->>pg: record the failure + product consequence · one transaction
  end
